team/apps/2996590/extras/07d7635e398c2a99cd7fe79762ed45fc.avif?t=1783386910\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996590/extras_big/07d7635e398c2a99cd7fe79762ed45fc.webp?t=1783386910 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soul Trigger is a 2-character tactical turn-based roguelite RPG set in an urban fantasy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character-driven storytelling, modular exploration, and half real-time combat come together for a uniquely immersive experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Side-View Tile-Based Half Real-Time Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996590/extras/e59f92d9bdc644846eaaa48f25d6f3d8.poster.avif?t=1783386910\" width=1170 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996590/extras/e59f92d9bdc644846eaaa48f25d6f3d8.webm?t=1783386910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996590/extras/e59f92d9bdc644846eaaa48f25d6f3d8.mp4?t=1783386910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique combat system blending turn-based depth with real-time tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control one character at a time on a side-view tile grid, swap with allies as the situation demands, and exploit enemy weaknesses to inflict [Down] for a tactical edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996590/extras/cc13172a25a93135140f599f6de6683f.poster.avif?t=1783386910\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996590/extras/cc13172a25a93135140f